NOTE ON DATA. This licence covers the source code and the written reports in
this repository only. It does NOT cover the satellite imagery used to produce
the results. That imagery comes from the Airbus Ship Detection Challenge
(https://www.kaggle.com/c/airbus-ship-detection) and remains subject to the
terms of that competition and to Airbus's own licensing. No imagery is
redistributed here; `code/scripts/wp0_build_dataset.py` rebuilds the dataset
from the original archive, which you must obtain yourself.

Trained model weights in this repository (where present) are derived from that
imagery and are shared for reproducibility of the reported results.
